E1 retraction-aware programs (D1s _ra), call estimator and offline key audit

The _ra programs declare the object ids they read; the sandbox makes an undeclared read an error
(locator fields stay free), and the layer hands each item's lineage to the program that replaces
it. The estimator replays cells with recording stand-ins and counts the distinct requests no
reference cell sends; the audit gives the detection of the source, gold and scope keys from the
worlds alone.

